sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst
    participant CLI as CLI / future local dashboard
    participant Workflow as analyze_raw_logs
    participant Rules as Detection and correlation
    participant Timeline as Timeline service
    participant Export as Reporting service
    Analyst->>CLI: Provide synthetic Linux + Windows samples
    CLI->>Workflow: Sources, year, UTC offset, YAML paths
    Workflow->>Workflow: Parse, normalize, deduplicate
    Workflow->>Rules: Evaluate auth rules and correlate
    Rules-->>Workflow: Findings and incidents
    Workflow->>Timeline: Add linked evidence and chronology
    Timeline-->>CLI: JSON-safe investigation report
    CLI->>Export: Build five CSV files + JSON + manifest
    Export-->>Analyst: Offline evidence-linked artifacts
    Note over Analyst,Export: Linked evidence is not complete log history
